37
00:02:06.392 --> 00:02:09.395
The Justice data Retrieval and Analysis
strategy.

38
00:02:09.796 --> 00:02:13.299
will implement your agent
using a multi-agent workflow

39
00:02:13.533 --> 00:02:18.533
that consists of a planner,
a plan, executer, and specialized agents

40
00:02:18.872 --> 00:02:21.741
such as web and data researchers,

41
00:02:21.741 --> 00:02:25.411
a data visualizer,
and response synthesizers.

42
00:02:26.379 --> 00:02:27.447
The planner

43
00:02:27.447 --> 00:02:30.517
takes the user's query and generates
a plan,

44
00:02:31.084 --> 00:02:35.822
and the plan Executer directs
the plan's execution and determines

45
00:02:36.156 --> 00:02:40.460
which specialized agent
should proceed based on the plan.

46
00:02:41.528 --> 00:02:44.697
Each agent shares
the output of its execution step

47
00:02:45.131 --> 00:02:48.568
and the plan executed
through the agent state.

48
00:02:48.935 --> 00:02:50.870
After each retrieval step.

49
00:02:50.870 --> 00:02:55.341
The plan execute A reflects on the plan
and decides whether to update it.

50
00:02:55.708 --> 00:03:00.547
You will evaluate both the quality
of retrievals and the quality of the plan.

51
00:03:01.147 --> 00:03:04.150
Was the plan
aligned with the user's request?

52
00:03:04.284 --> 00:03:07.287
The agent's actions aligned with the plan

53
00:03:07.453 --> 00:03:10.223
and executed efficiently and logically.

54
00:03:10.223 --> 00:03:14.127
You will then improve this agent
by adjusting its problems

55
00:03:14.460 --> 00:03:18.698
and implementing in line
or runtime evaluations.

56
00:03:18.965 --> 00:03:23.069
The inline evaluations will provide
the plan executer with real time

57
00:03:23.069 --> 00:03:26.873
scores for context relevance immediately
after any retrieval step.

58
00:03:27.607 --> 00:03:31.778
This will inform the plan Executer
whether the retrieval step

59
00:03:32.412 --> 00:03:35.915
lacked context relevance,
and if so, the plan Executer

60
00:03:36.115 --> 00:03:38.484
will ask the planner to adjust

61
00:03:38.484 --> 00:03:41.487
after you implement these improvements
to the agent's design,

62
00:03:41.788 --> 00:03:46.125
you will compare the offline
evaluation metrics, and both offline

63
00:03:46.125 --> 00:03:51.097
and real time evaluations rely on tracing
the agent that you will also learn about.

